# Heals at power 11 like damage (the owner's clip: Pam at power 11, 10000 hp, her turret +1400 a second).
# nbhost.h: P11_SCALE 2. env.c: the area create 0xb2aefc hooked (my_mkarea): a heal word (+0xe8 / +0xec < 0) from power-1
# numbers x2, not DamageScaleType 2 of a brawler owner; NB_HEAL_SCALE=0 off. superfix.c: a summon Hot area of
# DamageScaleType 2 (Pam's turrets) heals TURRET_HEAL_PCT 14 % of the summoner's max hp, else x2; Poco's super heal x2.
# superfix_status.c: status Healing x2. superfix_moves.c: R-T's rejoin heal x2.
# Paths relative to engine/.
